<title>BRAZIL: Brazil CS sugar output to January 16 - AIAA.</title>
<headline>Brazil CS sugar output to January 16 - AIAA.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results to January 16 of the 1996/97 sugar harvest in Brazil's centre-south region were as follows, said the Association of Sugar and Alcohol Industries of Sao Paulo (AIAA).</p>
<p>				     1996/97	     1995/96</p>
<p>				   16/01    01/01	16/01    01/01</p>
<p> SUGAR CANE(million tonnes)231.60   231.40     204.40.. 203.59</p>
<p> SUGAR(million tonnes)	10.43    10.42	 9.25     9.24</p>
<p> ALCOHOL(million cu meters) 12.11    12.09	10.86    10.83</p>
<p>--Joelle Diderich, Sao Paulo newsroom +55 11 248 5417</p>
</text>
